 muster











                                                      m u s t e r

                                      Deploy anything, anywhere — from one place.


                          s       Set up this folder      scan it and create muster.json
                          a       Add a server            deploy to it over SSH or Fleet Cloud
                          c       Sign in to Fleet Cloud  reach servers through the relay
                          D       Docker                  containers, images and disk here
                          ctrl+k  Commands                everything else, by name

















